            <a href="experiment-operation.html" class="card-main-link" id="link2">
                <div class="exp-icon"><i class="fas fa-tools"></i></div>
                <div class="exp-title">🧪 2. 实验操作方法</div>
                <div class="exp-desc">
                    <i class="fas fa-hand-sparkles"></i> 连接技巧、开关用法、电路故障排查，实验好习惯养成。
                </div>
                <div class="arrow-hint"><i class="fas fa-hand-point-right"></i> 点击学习</div>
            </a>
            <div class="info-btn" data-desc-index="1"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3：点亮灯泡的规律 -->
        <div class="exp-card" data-desc="✨ 通路、断路、短路的秘密！串联电路和并联电路区别，怎样更亮？发现点亮灯泡的黄金法则。">
            <a href="light-rules.html" class="card-main-link" id="link3">
                <div class="exp-icon"><i class="fas fa-charging-station"></i></div>
                <div class="exp-title">⚡ 3. 点亮灯泡的规律</div>
                <div class="exp-desc">
                    <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> 探究串联与并联，理解电流路径，让灯泡亮起来的小魔法。
                </div>
                <div class="arrow-hint"><i class="fas fa-hand-point-right"></i> 点击学习</div>
